<p>Asked to take a look at this, apologies for the delay.</p>
<p>So like, the general shape of what you have here is good. It's a very emotional narrative, clear beginning and end, etc. But like, you're pulling a lot of elements into this, and it becomes a tad unfocused. Like, the Gate Guardian and 343 are extremely old and generally not looked upon fondly by modern audiences, as is your portrayal of the Serpent's Hand as a sort of&#8230; murderous, militarized force. You're also pulling stuff in from Three Moons — it's extremely all over the place in site lore, and I'd recommend you focus on one particular thing to make it work.</p>
<p>Question, err, how did O5-2 and Orpheus meet (and why do they have the names of greek characters)? Additionally, how did O5-2 let her guard slip enough to get killed? How did the information leak? Etc.</p>

